== handoff missing
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff absent.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: load handoff: handoff source "absent.json" is not accessible: lstat <ROOT>/absent.json: no such file or directory


== goal missing
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal absent.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: bind goal: goal source "absent.json" is not accessible: lstat <ROOT>/absent.json: no such file or directory


== handoff is a symlink
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: load handoff: handoff source "handoff.json" must not be a symlink


== goal is a symlink
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: bind goal: goal source "goal.json" must not be a symlink


== handoff is a directory
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: load handoff: handoff source "handoff.json" must be a regular file


== goal is a directory
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: bind goal: goal source "goal.json" must be a regular file


== handoff through a symlinked directory out of the root
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff escape/handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: load handoff: handoff source "escape/handoff.json" resolves outside the worktree root


== goal through a symlinked directory out of the root
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal escape/goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: bind goal: goal source "escape/goal.json" resolves outside the worktree root


== handoff traverses above the root
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff ../handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: load handoff: handoffPath must not traverse outside the worktree root, got "../handoff.json"


== goal traverses above the root
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal sub/../../goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: bind goal: goalPath must not traverse outside the worktree root, got "sub/../../goal.json"


== handoff is an absolute path
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff <ROOT>/handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: load handoff: handoffPath must be relative, got "<ROOT>/handoff.json"


== goal is an absolute path
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal <ROOT>/goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: bind goal: goalPath must be relative, got "<ROOT>/goal.json"


== handoff is the root itself
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff . --goal goal.json
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: load handoff: handoffPath must not resolve to the worktree root itself, got "."


== goal is empty
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff handoff.json --goal 
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: shaper assess: --goal is required


== handoff in a nested directory
$ shaper assess --root <ROOT> --handoff ./nested/dir/../dir/handoff.json --goal goal.json
exit: 3
--- stdout ---
